    {
      "id": "p5:b1:l0:s0-30",
      "page": 5,
      "at": [
        1,
        0,
        0,
        30
      ],
      "source": "You have now shown that ‘triples’ do not exist if one wants a consistent algebra including",
      "point": [
        87.59100341796875,
        89.43499755859375
      ],
      "rect": [
        87.59100341796875,
        80.70771789550781,
        524.2495727539062,
        91.6168212890625
      ],
      "size": 10.909099578857422,
      "font": "SFRM1095",
      "font_role": "serif",
      "text": "이로써 곱셈을 포함하는 일관된 대수에서는 세 실수의 묶음이 존재하지 않으며,"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5:b1:l1:s0-14",
      "page": 5,
      "at": [
        1,
        1,
        0,
        14
      ],
      "source": "multiplication – they must be extended into quaternions.",
